  "title": "Sigmund Freud",
  "summary": "Born in Freiberg, Moravia, on 6 May 1856, Freud grew up in Vienna, studied medicine there and opened his practice in 1886. He is regarded as the founder of psychoanalysis. After Germany annexed Austria in 1938 he left for England, where he died on 23 September 1939.",
